  "historyNote": "#5611, eff 4-13-93; amd by #5734, eff 11-5-93 (From Pes 803.03); ss and moved by #5766, eff 12-28-93 (From Pes 804.03); ss by #6317, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12 New. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14 New. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13981, eff 5-31-24",
